<title>INDIA: India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 11.74 percent.</title>
<headline>India Kothari Pioneer MMMF yield at 11.74 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund said on Friday the yield on its money market mutual fund (MMMF) as on July 10 was 11.74 percent.</p>
<p>Kothari Pioneer Mutual Fund is a joint venture between India's Kothari Group and U.S. mutual fund Pioneer Inc.</p>
<p>	  The following are the Net Asset Value (NAV) for Kothari</p>
<p>Pioneer's other mutual funds. -------</p>
<p>    Name of Fund				NAV(Rs.per share)</p>
<p>    ------------				-----------------</p>
<p>    Prima fund					 10.84</p>
<p>    Prima plus					  8.15</p>
<p>    Bluechip fund				    14.20</p>
<p>    Taxshield	95				 8.66</p>
<p>			 96				12.83</p>
<p>			 97				12.47</p>
